    },
    "message": "Add a test-only tracked mirror that looks for writes it does not see\n\nA Python prototype of what the Rust port plans for model_state: dict and list\nsubclasses forward every write to a shadow document, a plain container is\nconverted on insert and its alias watched, and a run is compared phase by phase\nwith its shadow and with a plain run, in physical and read-reversed dict order.\nbenchmarks/tracked_mirror_gate.py runs that over the gate's scenarios, and the\npytest plugin runs the whole suite on it.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
